Z||000008||orystb||11-08-2000||01:25 PM||||The SHO motor sure looks good in there a little tight but I bet it will fly. I would like to know how you have got the motor mounts mounted in the Fiero. Are you using the automatic trans that came with the motor or the Fiero trans? Iam going to try the same swap hope I have as much luck as you are having. Any help would be apreciated.                        Thank You||||reg||14
